  "name": "Carrot Cake Pops",
  "subtitle": "Spiced carrot cake bites with chocolate coating",
  "description": "Bake a moist spiced carrot cake, combine it with cinnamon frosting, and finish the shaped pops with chocolate and simple decorations.",
